{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">熱帶風暴科羅旺在日本以南海域集結。受到鋒面及低氣壓影響，西日本及東日本廣泛地區下暴雨，遠至青森縣有山泥傾瀉，當局一度向部分地區發出疏散警報。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.RAIN-2300_001.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026VGnByCnaye1788362803.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JP.RAIN-2300_001.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">青森縣周三在降雨後，有私家車被淹浸，有橋樑被沖毀。氣象廳預計東北地區周四上午前，降雨量將達到100毫米，北海道就預計有80毫米降雨量。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\"><br/> <div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\"><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.RAIN-2300_003.jpg\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/09/2026DRZz0yK1os1788362819.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.JP.RAIN-2300_003.jpg\"/><br/> </div><br/></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">當局對青森縣部分地區發布4級暴雨危險預警和4級山崩危險預警，警告當地可能發生由暴雨引發的山泥傾瀉，呼籲民眾採取措施確保安全。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-02T22:04:28.608907+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}